{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23247","headline":"闲夜咏怀因招周协律刘薛二秀才 · 白居易","name":"闲夜咏怀因招周协律刘薛二秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世名检束爲朝士，心性疎慵是野夫。\n高置寒灯如客店，深藏夜火似僧炉。\n香浓酒熟能尝否，冷澹诗成肯和无。\n若厌雅吟须俗饮，妓筵勉力爲君铺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}